@startuml
title FEQ-D02 Fiscal Exception Authority Boundary
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Central PMS\npayment finality\nfiscal reference recording\nnormal fiscal-gated ExitAuthorization" as Central
component "POS Server\nfiscal issuance\nfiscal numbering" as POS
component "Fiscal Exception Queue\nassignment\nreadback/retry orchestration\nclosure recommendation/state" as FEQ
component "Operator Console\nvisibility/handoff only" as OC
component "Management Dashboard\nprojection/reporting only" as MDR
component "Gate / Exit\nconsume Central PMS authorization only" as Gate
component "Audit / Event\nimmutable trace" as Audit
component "Reconciliation\nfinancial/fiscal comparison and closure context" as Recon

FEQ --> Central : request approved state updates\nand record recovery outcome
FEQ --> POS : approved backend readback/retry\nwhen controls pass
FEQ --> Audit : audit all actions
FEQ --> Recon : provide evidence for\nreconciliation
OC --> FEQ : view/assign/escalate through\napproved workflow
MDR --> FEQ : read projection only
Central --> Gate : issue normal ExitAuthorization\nwhen eligible

FEQ -[#red,dashed]-> POS : no fiscal number editing\nor arbitrary document creation
FEQ -[#red,dashed]-> Gate : no gate open/consume
FEQ -[#red,dashed]-> Central : no payment finality mutation\nor ExitAuthorization issuance
OC -[#red,dashed]-> FEQ : no direct POS command
MDR -[#red,dashed]-> FEQ : no recovery command

note bottom
FEQ coordinates recovery but does not become payment, exit, gate,
entitlement, or POS fiscal authority.
end note
@enduml
